v class="location-desc">Zentralschweiz · Warteliste offen</div><span class="location-link">Akupunktur Luzern →</span></a></div></div></section></div> <div id="symptom-recommended-therapies"><section class="also-for-section"><div class="wrap"> <div class="section-label">Häufig eingesetzte Methoden</div> <h2 class="section-title">Diese Behandlungen helfen <em>bei Hallux valgus</em></h2> <div class="sx-chips" style="margin-top:20px;gap:10px"><button class="sx-chip-link" onclick="nav('therapie','akupunktur')"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="22"></line><path d="M9.5 5l2.5-3 2.5 3"></path><circle cx="12" cy="14.5" r="2.2"></circle></svg> Akupunktur</button><button class="sx-chip-link" onclick="nav('therapie','tuina')"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 12a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8 0v1.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-8 0V12z"></path><path d="M5.5 14.5c0 3.5 3 6.5 6.5 6.5s6.5-3 6.5-6.5"></path><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="7.5"></line></svg> Tuina Massage</button><button class="sx-chip-link" onclick="nav('therapie','moxibustion')"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c0 0-5 4.5-5 9a5 5 0 0 0 10 0c0-4.5-5-9-5-9z"></path><line x1="12" y1="11" x2="12" y2="14.5" stroke-width="1.5"></line></svg> Moxibustion</button></div> </div></section></div> <div id="symptom-related-section"><section style="background:#fff;padding:56px 0"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-label">Ähnliche Beschwerden</div><h2 class="section-title">Weitere Beschwerden</h2><div class="card-grid reveal"><a href="/beschwerden/plantarfasziitis/" class="svc-card reveal"><div class="svc-photo-top-bar"></div><div class="svc-photo-wrap"><img load