Beschwerden verstärkt</div></div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div></section> <div id="symptom-cities-section"><section class="related-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-label">Standorte</div><h2 class="section-title">Praxen <em>in deiner Nähe</em></h2><div class="city-grid reveal"><a href="/standorte/zuerich-oerlikon/" class="city-card location-card" onclick="event.preventDefault(); nav('standort','zuerich-oerlikon')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="location-plz">8050</span><div class="location-city">Zürich Oerlikon</div><div class="location-desc">Zürich Nord</div><span class="location-link">Termin prüfen →</span></a><a href="/standorte/zuerich-hoengg/" class="city-card location-card" onclick="event.preventDefault(); nav('standort','zuerich-hoengg')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="location-plz">8049</span><div class="location-city">Zürich Höngg</div><div class="location-desc">Zürich West</div><span class="location-link">Termin prüfen →</span></a><a href="/standorte/winterthur-muenzgasse/" class="city-card location-card" onclick="event.preventDefault(); nav('standort','winterthur-muenzgasse')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="location-plz">8400</span><div class="location-city">Winterthur Münzgasse</div><div class="location-desc">Nahe Zürich</div><span class="location-link">Termin prüfen →</span></a><a href="/standorte/kreuzlingen/" class="city-card location-card" onclick="event.preventDefault(); nav('standort','kreuzlingen')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="location-plz">8280</span><div class="location-city">Kreuzlingen</div><div class="location-desc">Am Bodensee</div><span class="location-link">Termin prüfen →</span></a><a href="/standorte/bottighofen/" class="city-card location-card" onclick="event.preventDefault(); nav('standort','bottighofen')" style="cursor:pointer"><span class="location-plz">8598</span><div class="location-city">Bottighofen</div><div class="location-desc">Am Bodensee · TCM Pelican</div><span class="loc-partne