oxibustion')"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22c3.5 0 6-2.4 6-5.7 0-4.3-4.3-5.6-3.4-10.3C11.8 7.4 9 9.6 9 13c0 1.6.7 2.6.7 2.6S8 14.7 8 12.6c-1.3 1.2-2 2.6-2 4.2C6 19.7 8.5 22 12 22z"></path></svg> Moxibustion</button></div> </div></section></div> <div id="symptom-related-section"><section style="background:#fff;padding:56px 0"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-label">Ähnliche Beschwerden</div><h2 class="section-title">Weitere Beschwerden</h2><div class="card-grid reveal"><a href="/beschwerden/plantarfasziitis/" class="svc-card reveal"><div class="svc-photo-top-bar"></div><div class="svc-photo-wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/img-4357832d6bef.webp" alt="Plantarfasziitis mit TCM behandeln | TCM.ch" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;"></div><div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-name">Plantarfasziitis</div><div class="svc-tagline">Schmerz in der Fusssohle, besonders morgens</div><div class="svc-cta">Mehr erfahren <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></div></div></a><a href="/beschwerden/fersensporn/" class="svc-card reveal"><div class="svc-photo-top-bar"></div><div class="svc-photo-wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/img-4357832d6bef.webp" alt="Fersensporn mit TCM behandeln | TCM.ch" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;"></div><div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-name">Fersensporn</div><div class="svc-tagline">Stechender Schmerz an der Ferse</div><div class="svc-cta">Mehr erfahren <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-l