ten in der Altstadt, wenige Gehminuten vom Hauptbahnhof: <a href="/standorte/winterthur-marktgasse/">Akupunktur Winterthur</a>.</p></div></section> <section class="section contact-section-inline" style="background:var(--surface)"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="contact-inline-grid"> <div class="reveal"> <div class="section-label">Passende Hilfe finden</div> <h2 class="section-title">Jetzt passende <em>Hilfe anfragen.</em></h2> <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:0">Kurz schildern, wir helfen dir beim passenden nächsten Schritt.</p> <div class="intake-trust-row"> <div class="intake-trust-item"><span class="intake-trust-dot"></span>Passende Praxis statt langem Suchen</div> <div class="intake-trust-item"><span class="intake-trust-dot"></span>Standorte in der Deutschschweiz</div> <div class="intake-trust-item"><span class="intake-trust-dot"></span>Krankenkassenanerkannt (Zusatzversicherung)</div> </div> <div class="contact-methods-mini" style="gap:8px"> <a href="https://wa.me/41775236122" class="contact-method-mini" target="_blank"> <div class="cm-icon-mini cm-wa"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893