ath><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="20"></line><line x1="9.5" y1="20" x2="14.5" y2="20"></line></svg></span> <div><div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black)">Schröpfen</div> <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Fördert die Durchblutung und löst Verklebungen</div></div> </div><div class="sidebar-row" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)" onclick="nav('therapie','tuina')"> <span style="font-size:18px"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 12a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8 0v1.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-8 0V12z"></path><path d="M5.5 14.5c0 3.5 3 6.5 6.5 6.5s6.5-3 6.5-6.5"></path><line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="7.5"></line></svg></span> <div><div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black)">Tuina Massage</div> <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Tiefe Griffe entlang Wade, Fuss und Oberschenkel</div></div> </div><div class="sidebar-row" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)" onclick="nav('therapie','moxibustion')"> <span style="font-size:18px"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22c3.5 0 6-2.4 6-5.7 0-4.3-4.3-5.6-3.4-10.3C11.8 7.4 9 9.6 9 13c0 1.6.7 2.6.7 2.6S8 14.7 8 12.6c-1.3 1.2-2 2.6-2 4.2C6 19.7 8.5 22 12 22z"></path></svg></span> <div><div style="font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black)">Moxibustion</div> <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Wärme bei kälteempfindlichen, krampfanfälligen Waden</div></div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div></section> <div id="symptom-cities-section"><section class="related-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-label">Standorte</div><h2 class="section-title">Praxen <em>in deiner Nähe</em></h2><div 